{
  "profile": "qrlesspay-v1.1-proposal",
  "note": "UWB ranging tokens. The spec defines no wire format for UWB; these pin the proposal so two implementations cannot drift before it is adopted. The rejection cases matter most: a token from the other platform must FAIL to decode, never be misread as a malformed local one.",
